     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The fix will likely involve updating the JcrPropertyStatementListener.java to collect exceptions (not just exception.getMessage) and throw the javax.jcr.AccessDeniedException if it is caught, otherwise continue to throw a MalformedRdfException.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
